{%- comment -%}
  Hartwick Atelier — OLD-SITE PAGES (4 October 2026, Ivan: "some pages are
  still using the old pages from old website though there are new design").

  Given a page handle, prints where that page now lives, or nothing. Read by
  snippets/ha-old-pages-redirect (the visit is sent on) and by the search
  sections (the page is left out of results). The pages themselves are not
  deleted or unpublished — remove a line here and the page shows again.

    story, copy-of-the-collection, slow-fashion   -> About the Atelier
        (slow-fashion still holds Luxe's demo copy, "Talk about your brand")
    heritage-craft, materials-process (empty)     -> The Masters
    faq (Luxe's demo "Collapsible row" only)      -> Policies
    press, the AW24 press release and media
    library, events (the autumn 2024 launch)      -> Contact (press line)

  Kept as they are: size-guide (linked from every product page, already in
  the Hartwick style) and data-sharing-opt-out (the legal privacy page).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  case handle
    when 'story', 'copy-of-the-collection', 'slow-fashion'
      echo '/pages/about-the-atelier'
    when 'heritage-craft', 'materials-process'
      echo '/pages/the-masters'
    when 'faq'
      echo '/pages/policies'
    when 'press', 'hartwick-atelier-autumn-2024-press-release', 'hartwick-atelier-autumn-2024-media-library', 'events'
      echo '/pages/contact-us'
  endcase
-%}
